ng, then completed levels descending, then earliest finish, then run ID. Weekly window begins Monday 00:00 UTC. Records stay in this browser and can be edited or cleared by its user. Degrees use the current milestones; legacy honors are shown separately and do not alter score ordering.</p><div class="online-panel"><span>ONLINE RANKINGS</span><h2>The worldwide hall is not connected.</h2><p>Global competition needs accounts, server-owned run sessions, and server-side answer and score validation. Local scores are not submitted as trusted global scores.</p></div>${button('← BACK TO TITLE','title','button')}</section>`}
function guideScreen(){return `<section class="menu-screen"><p class="kicker">PLAYER’S MANUAL</p><p class="manual-version">CURRENT VERSION ${gameVersion}</p><h1>KNOW THE <span>RULES.</span></h1><div class="manual-grid"><article><b>01 / SURVIVE THE RUN</b><p>Start with five lives. Remaining lives carry between levels; retries restore five. Defeat each opponent with ten correct answers, each dealing 10% damage. Questions continue until the opponent falls or your lives run out. Wrong answers and expired timers cost one life. Read the explanation before continuing; its timer is stopped.</p></article><article><b>02 / BUILD YOUR STREAK</b><p>Correct answers start at 100 points. The multiplier rises every three consecutive correct answers, up to ×5. A mistake resets the streak. Boss levels double answer points. A perfect level adds 500 + 50 × level points.</p></article><article><b>03 / MASTER THE GATES</b><p>Seven overlapping knowledge stages span 75 levels each. Questions gradually progress from recall to context and multi-passage reasoning as reviewed content becomes available. Earlier subjects remain in rotation. Every fifth level is a Gatekeeper round, prioritizing Tradition, Context, and Misquote Traps. Combat timers are unchanged; mastery ranks follow the completed-level milestones below.</p></article><article><b>04 / USE YOUR ARMORY</b><p>Start each run with three 50:50 uses, two +15-second boosts, and one shield. Two consecutive flawless clears (ten correct, no mistakes) restore one use to the most depleted starting stock (ties: 50:50, time, shield), then reset the flawless streak. Stocks stay capped at 3 / 2 / 1; a full inventory gives no extra use. Mistakes, defeat and restarting an incomplete level break the streak. Previously completed levels do not earn duplicate restoration rewards. The shield protects one question from life loss, but a wrong answer still breaks your streak. Pause freezes the clock. Hiding the tab pauses automatically.</p></article></div><h2>